{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a Planet Racer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience<strong>\u00a0</strong>a <strong>sci-fi racing game</strong> where you compete at high speeds across different planets. Each race challenges you to reach the finish line first. Winning unlocks new tracks and planets while earning you credits to spend on new vehicles or upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your racers to improve speed, handling, and booster as you progress through tougher competitions. With detailed environments, smooth gameplay, and an energetic soundtrack, <strong>Planet Racer</strong> offers a fast-paced racing experience set among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024510/extras/ef401e78d014eec399263592df05b1e6.poster.avif?t=1769523957\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024510/extras/ef401e78d014eec399263592df05b1e6.webm?t=1769523957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024510/extras/ef401e78d014eec399263592df05b1e6.mp4?t=1769523957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic single-player story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No track boundaries - race freely between checkpoints</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique planets with over 30 circuits to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and upgrade new racers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each opponent has their own personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online ranking system \u2013 climb to the top of the leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p cla